123
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:46,750
Otherwise, the horse is gonna go into the bedroom and change into her sweatpants.
不然我要回房 換上我的運動褲

124
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:53,190
-Okay, you don't know. You didn't see it. -Childbirth is beautiful.
-好吧，你不知道，你沒有看到它 -生孩子的過程很美

125
00:08:53,390 --> 00:08:55,920
Oh, beautiful? Really?
很美？真的嗎？

126
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:58,600
You think this is beautiful?
你覺得這很美嗎？

127
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:06,240
Oh, my God! No wonder my mother hates me!
天啊 難怪我媽恨我

128
00:09:08,210 --> 00:09:11.010
-See, honey, there's.. -Don't touch me!
-甜心… -別碰我

129
