00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:20,530
I'll tell her my pregnant ex-girlfriend is living with me.
我會告訴她我懷孕的前女友 跟我一起住

161
00:11:20,780 --> 00:11:25,680
If I haven't said it before, she's a lucky, lucky lady.
或許我沒有說過 她是個非常幸運的女人

162
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:30,740
So where are..? What the crap is up with this stuff?
我們… 這個玩意怎麼了？

163
00:11:32,950 --> 00:11:36,620
Is it gum? Is it food? What's the deal?
它是口香糖嗎？它是食物嗎？ 怎麼了？

164
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,360
Oh, it's nice. May I try a pink one?
好好吃 我能試試粉紅色的嗎？

165
00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47,630
So I just have to plan the perfect night.
我得計劃 這個完美的夜晚

166
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,830
Hey, what's the best date you ever had?
你最棒的約會經驗 是什麼？

167
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:53,570
Last year, Greg Hayman took me to a very nice sushi dinner.
去年葛瑞格海曼 帶我去吃很好吃的壽司大餐

168
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:56,680
Then we took a romantic walk to a nearby research lab..
我們散步 到附近的研究室…

169
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,440
where we trashed the place and freed 20 monkeys.
我們闖進裡面 放走二十隻猴子

170
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:05,280
I knew it! I knew I wasn't crazy!
我就知道 我就知道我沒有發瘋

171
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:09,310
Last year, a monkey did attack me at the bus stop!
去年的確有一隻猴子 在公車站攻擊我

172
00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:17,330
So between her and me being friends, and her history with Ross..
她跟我是朋友 她跟羅斯交往過…

173
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:19,620
it just isn't gonna happen.
這種事絕不能發生

174
00:12:19,870 --> 00:12:24,130
It'd be like you falling in love with a cat.
那就像是 你愛上一隻貓

175
00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27,630
-Hey. -Hey.
-嘿 -嘿

176
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:32,540
How's my favorite dog, huh? How's my favorite dog?
我最喜歡的狗怎麼了？ 他還好嗎？

177
00:12:33,410 --> 00:12:35,140
You're subdued.
你太壓抑了

178
00:12:35,350 --> 00:12:39,150
-Did you give him a beer? -No.
-你讓他喝啤酒了？ -不

179
00:12:39,620 --> 00:12:43,320
-Will you excuse us? We need to talk. -Sure.
-對不起，我們需要談一談 -當然

180
00:12:44,530 --> 00:12:46,490
Oh, me, right.
我，對

181
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:53.030
-He's miserable. What happened to him? -Nothing.
-他很難過，他是怎麼了？ -沒事

182
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,630
-We talked about stuff. -What stuff?
-我們聊了一些事 -什麼事？

183
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,270
Rachel stuff.
關於瑞秋的事

184
00:12:58,870 --> 00:13:04,280
Oh, Joey, you bummed him out! This is the happiest dog in the world.
喬伊，你害得他很難過 他是全世界最快樂的狗

185
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:06,950
He spends a day with you, and look!
他才跟你相處一天，你看

186
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,680
He's breathing.
他還在呼吸

187
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:15,150
Okay, well, he's watching us so just look happy, okay?
好吧，他在看著我們 表現的快樂一點，好嗎？

188
00:13:21,230 --> 00:13:23,560
-I'll take him to Wendy's. -He's fine.
-我要帶他去溫蒂家 -他很好

189
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,890
Look.
你看

190
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,500
Here's your ball!
快接球

191
00:13:26,730 --> 00:13:30.000
Get your ball! Get your ball!
去接球 去接球

192
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:32,530
Get..
去…

193
00:13:33,670 --> 00:13:34,940
Of course.
當然

194
00:13:35,110 --> 00:13:37.010
You don't want a tennis ball.
你不要網球

195
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:40,170
Not when you can have a meatball.
因為你可以吃肉球

196
00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44,110
Come on, get the meatball.
來吧，去接肉球

197
00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50,250
God, what have I done to you?
天啊，我對你做了什麼？

198
00:13:50,490 --> 00:13:54,120
I broke the dog, Pheebs! I broke the dog!
我害死那隻狗了，菲比 我把他弄得精神崩潰了

199
00:13:59,230 --> 00:14:00,560
Thanks.
謝謝

200
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:10,200
I'm going to pick up Mona. What are you doing tonight?
我要去接蒙娜 今晚你要做什麼？

201
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,880
Oh, I got big Valentine's plans.
我有很棒的情人節計劃

202
00:14:13,110 --> 00:14:17,380
I got my Chinese food on the way, and your saltwater taffy.
我訂了中國菜 還有你的鹹水太妃糖

203
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:21,850
Interestingly, it isn't made with seawater..
真有趣 它沒有加海水…

204
00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:25,360
We actually watched the documentary together.
我們是一起 看那部紀錄片的

205
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:29,730
Oh, my Chinese food. I'll get my cash.
我的外賣來了 我去拿錢

206
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,570
Mona?
蒙娜

207
00:14:37,870 --> 00:14:40,430
What are..? Hi! How are you?
什麼… 嗨，你好嗎？

208
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:43,180
I'm supposed to pick you up.
我應該去接你的

209
00:14:43,410 --> 00:14:47,240
I made you a Valentine's dinner. Surprise!
我幫你做了情人節晚餐 大驚喜

210
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:55,120
-Oh! Hey, Mona! -Hi, Rachel.
-蒙娜 -嗨，瑞秋

211
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:57,420
What's she doing here?
她在這裡做什麼？

212
00:14:57,790 --> 00:14:59,990
I have no idea.
我不知道

213
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:04,290
I'll be watching TV if anybody needs me.
如果你們要找我 我在房裡看電視

214
00:15:04,970 --> 00:15:06,400
What is she doing?
她在做什麼？

215
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:09,970
Lately she just likes hanging out here.
最近 她喜歡待在這裡

216
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:13,500
-Why? -I think she's lonely.
-為什麼？ -我想她很寂寞

217
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:17,640
But it's Valentine's Day. Can't we ask her to go?
但今天是情人節 我們能請她離開嗎？

218
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:21,180
Well, no, she's way too emotional.
不行，她太激動了

219
00:15:21,450 --> 00:15:24,820
And by emotional, I mean crazy!
我是說她瘋了

220
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:30,350
That's just my Chinese food.
我的外賣來了

221
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:32,550
She has food delivered here?
她叫外賣送到這裡來？

222
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:37,560
Yes, she's emotional, but ballsy.
對，她很激動，但她大膽

223
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:43,630
I'm gonna get in my sweats and eat this in bed.
我要去換運動服 躺在床上吃飯

224
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:50,500
And you thought she was gonna be in our way!
你還以為 她會妨礙到我們

225
00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:55,380
Open the champagne, and I will be right back.
打開香檳 我馬上回來

226
00:15:55,650 --> 00:15:59,950
-I've got a surprise. -You got another ex-wife back there?
-我有大驚喜 -你另一個前妻也藏在裡面？

227
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:03,450
Please start drinking.
請開始喝香檳

228
00:16:08,530 --> 00:16:11,730
-I'm just gonna grab the phone. -Rachel, wait.
-我只是要打電話 -瑞秋，等一下

229
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:15,600
I hope you don't take this the wrong way.
我希望 你不會誤會

230
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:19,200
-What are you doing? -Do you need the phone?
-你在做什麼？ -你要打電話嗎？

231
00:16:19,710 --> 00:16:21,230
No.
不

232
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:25,410
Ross is too nice to say it, but this is his apartment.
羅斯太好心了沒辦法說出口 但這是他的公寓

233
00:16:25,610 --> 00:16:29,980
We need boundaries, so why don't you go back to your place.
我們需要隱私 你為什麼不回你家呢？

234
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:33,180
But, Mona, I live here.
蒙娜，我住在這裡

235
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:39.090
Happy Valentine's Day!
情人節快樂

236
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:47,930
Or, something to remember me by.
或者這能讓你在分手後記得我

237
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:59,500
-How long has it been this time? -Ninety seconds.
-這次是多久？ -九十秒

238
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:03,580
Ninety seconds is a long time not to think about it.
九十秒沒想到它 真的很久

239
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:06,510
Except all I did was think about it.
但我滿腦子都是它

240
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,380
I know. It haunts me.
我知道，我也忘不了

241
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:14,420
Till now, the worst thing I'd seen was my dad doing shots off the houseboy.
在這之前我看過最糟糕的事 是我爸跟服務生上床

242
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:18,790
After this, I would gladly make that my screen saver.
在這之後我會很樂意 把他們的照片做成屏幕保護程式

243
00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:24.090
We have to get past this. We'll pretend it never existed.
我們得忘了這件事 我們得假裝它不存在

244
00:17:24,570 --> 00:17:25,770
I could do that.
我可以那麼做

245
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:34,740
Now all we gotta do is get rid of this chair.
我們只需要 丟掉那張椅子

246
00:17:49,130 --> 00:17:51,620
-Oh, thank God! -I know.
-謝天謝地 -我知道

247
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:53,770
Come in!
請進

248
00:17:53,930 --> 00:17:57.030
Hi. I'm sorry to barge in on your Valentine.
我很抱歉 破壞了你們的情人節

249
00:17:57,200 --> 00:18:01.000
I had to get away from the yelling. Mona's dumping Ross.
我得遠離那些叫罵聲 蒙娜要跟羅斯分手

250
00:18:01,210 --> 00:18:03,570
-Oh, my God. -Poor Ross.
-天啊 -可憐的羅斯

251
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:12,180
We watch him do yoga in his underwear, but for this he closes the drapes.
我們看過他穿內褲做瑜珈 但這次他更慘

252
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:16,780
You know that birthing tape you wanted to see?
關於那卷 你想看的生產錄影帶

253
00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.080
It's here.
它在這裡

254
00:18:18,290 --> 00:18:22,390
We should warn you before you watch it. Don't watch it.
我們得在你看它之前警告你 千萬別看它

255
00:18:23,330 --> 00:18:25,130
You saw it? Is it scary?
你們看過了？很可怕嗎？

256
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:28,860
It's ironic how footage of someone being born..
諷刺的是 生孩子的畫面…

257
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:32,100
can make you want to kill yourself.
讓人想要自殺

258
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:37.070
Honey, she may not have to watch it but she's going to have to do it.
甜心，她不必看它 但她非生孩子不可

259
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:41,240
Now I'm all freaked out. Will you watch it with me?
現在我嚇壞了 你們能跟我一起看嗎？

260
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:46.080
No, but I'll leave a sweater that smells like me right next to you.
不，但我會把有我體味的毛衣 放在你旁邊

261
00:18:46,750 --> 00:18:48,580
Monica, come on. You want to have kids.
摩妮卡，少來了 你想生孩子

262
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,620
I do.
沒錯

263
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:53,190
But the stork is gonna bring mine.
但送子鳥 會把寶寶送來給我

264
00:18:54,530 --> 00:18:58.090
Seriously, you're not gonna make me watch this alone.
說真的 你們不能逼我一個人看這個

265
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:03,930
She's right. Of course not.
她說的對，當然不行

266
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:06,300
Honey, get the tape.
甜心，去拿錄影帶

267
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:17,340
This reminds me of a very specific part of the tape.
這讓我想起了 錄影帶裡某一段內容

268
00:19:18,150 --> 00:19:21,710
Oh, sure. But if you leave a drumstick under there and you're a bad roommate.
當然，如果你把雞腿放在那裡 你是個爛室友

269
00:19:24,390 --> 00:19:25,520
Here we go.
來吧

270
00:19:25,730 --> 00:19:27,420
Okay.
好吧

271
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:31,220
Oh, my.
天啊

272
00:19:32,570 --> 00:19:34,900
Come on, come on.
加油

273
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:38,440
Why is that baby torturing that woman?
為什麼寶寶要折磨那個女人？

274
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:42,130
Why have I seen this thing three times?
為什麼我要看這個玩意三次？

275
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:45,370
It's beautiful.
好美

276
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:51,210
-It's horrible! -I know, I know! I'm so sorry for you!
-好可怕 -我知道，我為你感到難過

277
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:54,990
What do I do? I don't want to do this! How do I get out of it?
我該怎麼辦？我不要做這個 我要怎麼把寶寶丟掉？

278
00:19:56,290 --> 00:20:00,450
-You guys! You guys, look! -What? Did her ass explode?
-大家快看 -什麼？她的屁股爆炸了嗎？

279
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:06.090
No, the baby's out. Look.
不，寶寶出來了，你們看

280
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:11,930
Look at those little fingers and toes.
看看那些小手指跟小腳趾

281
00:20:12,170 --> 00:20:14,270
Look how happy the mom is now.
看看媽媽現在有多高興

282
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:19,880
-Oh, Rach. -Screw you! You don't have to do it!
-瑞秋 -去你們的，你們不必生小孩

283
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:25,780
-Hey. -Hey!
-嘿 -嘿

284
00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:29,580
-What's up? -Mona just dumped me.
-怎麼了？ -蒙娜剛剛甩了我

285
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:32,590
Oh, man, I'm sorry. Why?
天啊，我很遺憾，為什麼？

286
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:37,290
Lately, I haven't exactly been the perfect boyfriend.
最近我不是 完美男友

287
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:40,130
I didn't tell her I got Rachel pregnant.
我沒有告訴她 我讓瑞秋懷孕

288
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:45,460
I gave her a key to my apartment and then had the locks changed.
我給她我家的鑰匙 然後換了鎖

289
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:49,230
Then I lied to her about Rachel moving in with me.
我騙她 瑞秋搬到我家的事

290
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:54,410
In a way, I judge her for not breaking up with me sooner.
在某方面 我怪她不早點跟我分手

291
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:58,420
That really sucks. Especially on Valentine's Day.
那真的很爛 特別是在情人節

292
00:20:58,620 --> 00:21:02,320
Wait a minute. What are you doing here?
等一下 你在這裡做什麼？

293
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:05,420
Joey without a date on Valentine's Day?
喬伊在情人節 沒有約會？

294
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:08,960
What's going on, huh? Girl trouble?
發生了什麼事？你跟女人有麻煩？

295
00:21:10,430 --> 00:21:12,760
-Sort of. -Really?
-可以那麼說 -真的嗎？

296
00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15,870
You don't have to seem so happy about it.
你不必表現得這麼高興

297
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:18,640
Maybe I can help.
或許我能幫忙

298
00:21:20,470 --> 00:21:23,840
Whatever it is, I am sure it has happened to me.
不論發生了什麼事 我相信我也有相同的經驗

299
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:28,940
You know, actually, once I got dumped during sex.
事實上 我有次在做愛時被甩了

300
00:21:33,990 --> 00:21:38.010
-So anyway, what is it? -Forget about it. It's no big deal.
-到底發生了什麼事？ -算了，沒什麼大不了的

301
00:21:38,290 --> 00:21:40,760
-Come on, what is it? -It's nothing.
-少來了，怎麼了？ -沒事

302
00:21:40,990 --> 00:21:43,760
Hey, it's me. Why can't you tell me?
是我 你為什麼不告訴我？

303
00:21:46,270 --> 00:21:49,860
Okay. Sit down.
好吧，坐下

304
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:57,510
There's this woman that I like a lot.
我很喜歡一個女人

305
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,870
But it can't happen.
但那是不可能的

306
00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:02,640
She's not a Tribbiani?
她不會是你的姐妹吧？

307
00:22:05,350 --> 00:22:06,480
No!
不

308
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:10,890
So is she someone from work?
她是你的同事？

309
00:22:12,430 --> 00:22:13,480
Yes.
對

310
00:22:14,190 --> 00:22:16.060
Well, does she like you?
她喜歡你嗎？

311
00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:20,360
Sometimes I think she could.
有時候我覺得是的

312
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:23,190
But I can't do anything about it.
但我什麼事都不能做

313
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:24,530
Why not?
為什麼？

314
00:22:24,810 --> 00:22:26,530
It's complicated.
事情很複雜

315
00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:30,600
She was with this other guy for a long time.
她跟另一個男人 交往了很久

316
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:33.040
Someone from work too.
他也是我的同事

317
00:22:34,580 --> 00:22:38,110
I could never do that to the guy. We're friends.
我沒辦法那樣對他 我們是好朋友

318
00:22:38,820 --> 00:22:40,880
Wait, I thought you hated everyone at work.
等一下 我以為你討厭所有的同事

319
00:22:41,150 --> 00:22:44,150
No, no. I only say that..
不，我會那麼說…

320
00:22:44,620 --> 00:22:49,250
so Chandler won't feel threatened because I'm his only friend.
錢德才不會覺得被威脅了 因為我是他唯一的朋友

321
00:22:52,230 --> 00:22:53,560
Excuse me?
你說什麼？

322
00:22:53,730 --> 00:22:56,230
Sorry, sorry. And I'm your only friend too.
抱歉 我也是你唯一的朋友

323
00:23:00,170 --> 00:23:05,370
So this guy she used to go out with, is he still in love with her?
以前跟她交往過的那個男人 還愛著她嗎？

324
00:23:05,580 --> 00:23:08,480
-No, I don't think so. -Okay.
-我想應該不愛了 -好吧

325
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:10,480
Is he a good guy?
他是好人嗎？

326
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:14.050
Yeah, he's the best.
對，他是最棒的

327
00:23:14,250 --> 00:23:16,980
-Then talk to him. -I don't know.
-跟他談一談 -我不知道

328
00:23:17,190 --> 00:23:20,390
It's worth finding out, if you like her.
如果你喜歡她 這值得試一試

329
00:23:20,590 --> 00:23:22,220
I do, so much.
我真的非常喜歡她

330
00:23:22,500 --> 00:23:25,290
I can't stop thinking about her. I can't sleep..
我沒辦法不想到她 我睡不著…

331
00:23:25,570 --> 00:23:29.000
You know what? You have to go for it.
你知道嗎？ 你得盡力去爭取

332
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:34,370
How often does this happen to you? You owe it to yourself.
你常遇到這種事嗎？ 你應該為自己這麼做的

333
00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.030
Here's your warm milk.
你的溫牛奶來了

334
00:23:41,580 --> 00:23:44,640
I'm gonna put the bourbon in it at home.
我要回家 加點波本酒

335
00:23:46,650 --> 00:23:51,610
Anyway, seriously, just talk to the guy, okay?
說真的 跟那個男的談一談，好嗎？

336
00:23:51,790 --> 00:23:54,260
Let me know how it goes.
告訴我結果

337
00:23:55,660 --> 00:23:57,600
It's Rachel.
是瑞秋

338
00:24:07,410 --> 00:24:10,570
You're having a baby and you need to prepare.
你要生孩子了 你得做好準備

339
00:24:10,780 --> 00:24:15,680
You're gonna make yourself watch the whole thing. Just do it!
你得看完整卷錄影帶 看吧

340
00:24:18,890 --> 00:24:22,450
I came to the big city to become a star.
我來到這個大城市 希望成為大明星

341
00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:27,290
-I'll do anything to make that happen. -Anything?
-為了圓夢我任何事都願意做 -任何事？

342
00:24:27,460 --> 00:24:31,990
Maybe it starts with how she gets pregnant.
或許我該從她 怎麼懷孕開始看起

343
00:24:34,840 --> 00:24:37,330
I wonder which one of these guys becomes the father.
不知道哪個男人 是孩子的爸

344
00:24:40,570 --> 00:24:42,670
No, no. Can't get pregnant that way.
不 那樣子是不會懷孕的

345
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000


346
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
